sty","model":"tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","usage":{"input":51,"output":28,"cacheRead":63552,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":4,"totalTokens":63631,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784921869230,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-c67f1a7e-b707-40ba-80a7-bad6da7c7977","responseModel":"moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.bash:101","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n> tdd-experiment-run@ test /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_19-26-36_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_kimi-k2-7-no-thinking\n> vitest run\n\n\n RUN  v1.6.1 /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_19-26-36_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_kimi-k2-7-no-thinking\n\n ✓ src/claim-office.spec.ts  (35 tests | 14 skipped) 7ms\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  21 passed | 14 todo (35)\n   Start at  19:37:51\n   Duration  194ms (transform 36ms, setup 0ms, collect 36ms, tests 7ms, environment 0ms, prepare 53ms)\n\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784921871272},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Refactor.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.subagent:102","name":"subagent","arguments":{"agent":"refactor","agentScope":"both","task":"Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 21\nRecent Green phase: Added validation that throws on unknown item types during quote base-premium calculation.\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","usage":{"input":240,"output":102,"cacheRead":63616,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":4,"totalTokens":63958,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784921871274,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-d31c7575-6a8e-47e9-9e0d-ce76646ab321","responseModel":"moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.subagent:102","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Refactoring Complete.\n\n**Refactorings Applied**\n\n1. **Naming — `stepIndex` → `isFollowUp`**\n   - `quotePremium` only used the third argument to decide \"is this a follow-up step?\". Renaming the parameter to `isFollowUp: boolean` makes the caller's intent explicit.\n   - Updated the call site in `processScenario` from `quotePremium(..., i)` to `quotePremium(..., i >= 1)`.\n\n2. **Extract `roundUpGold` helper**\n   - The expression `Math.floor((totalScaled + SCALING - 1) / SCALING)` is a ceiling division that converts scaled copper units up to whole gold. Extracting it as `roundUpGold(scaledAmount)` reveals that intent.\n\n3. **Make `itemSurchargeRate` a pure expression**\n   - Replaced the mutable `let rate` with `if`/`+=` blocks by a direct sum of two conditional terms. This removes mutation, reduces mass, and makes the \"curse + high-enchantment\" surcharge structure immediately visible.\n\n**APP Mass Calculation**\n\n| Function | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| `itemSurchargeRate` | 27 | 17 |\n| `quotePremium` | 46 | 34 |\n| `roundUpGold` (new) | — | 10 |\n| **Changed-function total** | **73** | **61** |\n\nCall-site adjustment in `processScenario`: the `>= 1` comparison moved from inside `quotePremium` to the argument list, adding ~3 mass there. Overall program mass decreased by approximately **9**.\n\n**Tests**: All 21 passing tests remain green; 14 claim-related tests still skipped as expected.\n\n```\n✓ src/claim-office.spec.ts  (35 tests | 14 skipped)\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\nTests  21 passed | 14 todo (35)\n```\n\n**TypeScript**: `npx tsc --noEmit` passes with no errors."}],"details":{"mode":"single","agentScope":"both","projectAgentsDir":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_19-26-36_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_kimi-k2-7-no-thinking/.pi/agents","results":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 21\nRecent Green phase: Added validation that throws on unknown item types during quote base-premium calculation.\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done.","exitCode":0,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task: Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 21\nRecent Green phase: Added validation that throws on unknown item types during quote base-premium calculation.\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done."}],"timestamp":1784921873186},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me start by reading the implementation and test files to understand the code.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.read:0","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_19-26-36_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_kimi-k2-7-no-thinking/src/claim-office.ts"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.read:1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_19-26-36_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_kimi-k2-7-no-thinking/src/claim-office.spec.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","usage":{"input":90,"output":146,"cacheRead":5568,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":16,"totalTokens":5804,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784921873206,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-c4199405-34d1-4213-bc9e-3184e7f10b41","responseModel":"moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.read:0","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"const PROCESSING_FEE = 5;\nconst SCALING = 20;\nconst PROCESSING_FEE_SCALED = PROCESSING_FEE * SCALING;\n\nconst BASE_PREMIUMS: Record<string, number> = {\n  sword: 100,\n  amulet: 60,\n  staff: 80,\n  potion: 40,\n};\n\nconst COMPONENT_PREMIUM = 25;\nconst COMPONENT_BLOCK_PREMIUM = 60;\nconst COMPONENT_BLOCK_SIZE = 3;\nconst COMPONENT_TYPES = new Set([\"rune\", \"moonstone\"]);\n\nconst CURSE_RATE = 10; // 50% == 10/20\nconst HIGH_ENCHANT_RATE = 6; // 30% == 6/20\nconst FIRST_INSURANCE_RATE = 2; // 10% == 2/20\nconst FOLLOW_UP_RATE = -3; // -15% == -3/20\nconst LOYALTY_RATE = -4; // -20% == -4/20\n\ntype Item = {\n  type: string;\n  material?: string;\n  enchantment?: number;\n  cursed?: boolean;\n};\n\ntype Step = {\n  op?: string;\n  items?: Array<Item>;\n};\n\ntype Scenario = {\n  customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: number };\n  steps: Array<Step>;\n};\n\nfunction isComponent(item: Item): boolean {\n  return COMPONENT_TYPES.has(item.type);\n}\n\nfunction itemSurchargeRate(item: Item): number {\n  let rate = 0;\n  if (item.cursed) {\n    rate += CURSE_RATE;\n  }\n  if ((item.enchantment ?? 0) >= 5) {\n    rate += HIGH_ENCHANT_RATE;\n  }\n  return rate;\n}\n\nfunction calculateBaseAndSurcharges(items: Array<Item>): { policyBase: number; surchargeScaled: number } {\n  let policyBase = 0;\n  let surchargeScaled = 0;\n  const componentCounts: Record<string, number> = {};\n\n  for (const item of items) {\n    if (isComponent(item)) {\n      componentCounts[item.type] = (componentCounts[item.type] ?? 0) + 1;\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    const itemBase = BASE_PREMIUMS[item.type];\n    if (itemBase === undefined) {\n      throw new Error(`Unknown item type: ${item.type}`);\n    }\n    policyBase += itemBase;\n    surchargeScaled += itemBase * itemSurchargeRate(item);\n  }\n\n  for (const count of Object.values(componentCounts)) {\n    policyBase += count === COMPONENT_BLOCK_SIZE ? COMPONENT_BLOCK_PREMIUM : count * COMPONENT_PREMIUM;\n  }\n\n  return { policyBase, surchargeScaled };\n}\n\nfunction quotePremium(items: Array<Item>, customerYears: number, stepIndex: number): number {\n  const { policyBase, surchargeScaled } = calculateBaseAndSurcharges(items);\n  const policyRate =\n    FIRST_INSURANCE_RATE +\n    (stepIndex >= 1 ? FOLLOW_UP_RATE : 0) +\n    (customerYears >= 2 ? LOYALTY_RATE : 0);\n\n  const totalScaled = policyBase * (SCALING + policyRate) + surchargeScaled + PROCESSING_FEE_SCALED;\n  return Math.floor((totalScaled + SCALING - 1) / SCALING);\n}\n\nexport function processScenario(scenario: unknown): { results: Array<{ premium: number }> } {\n  const typed = scenario as Scenario;\n  const customerYears = typed.customer.yearsWithMHPCO;\n  const results: Array<{ premium: number }> = [];\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < typed.steps.length; i++) {\n    const step = typed.steps[i];\n    if (step.op === \"quote\") {\n      results.push({ premium: quotePremium(step.items ?? [], customerYears, i) });\n    }\n  }\n\n  return { results };\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784921874298},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.read:1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"import { describe, it, expect } from \"vitest\";\nimport { processScenario } from \"./claim-office.js\";\n\ndescribe(\"MHPCO Claim Office\", () => {\n  // Quote basics\n  it(\"should quote premium 5 G for an empty item list (processing fee only)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 5 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote premium 115 G for a single sword (base 100 + 10% first insurance + 5 fee)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\" }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 115 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote premium 71 G for a single amulet\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"amulet\" }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 71 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote premium 93 G for a single staff\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"staff\" }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 93 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote premium 49 G for a single potion\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"potion\" }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 49 }] });\n  });\n\n  // Components and building blocks\n  it(\"should quote premium 60 G for 2 runes (2 * 25 base + 10% fee modifiers + 5 fee)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 60 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote premium 71 G for 3 runes (block base 60 + 10% + 5 fee)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 71 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote premium 115 G for 4 runes (no block, 4 * 25 + 10% + 5 fee)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: Array.from({ length: 4 }, () => ({ type: \"rune\" })) }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 115 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote premium 198 G for 7 runes (7 * 25 + 10% + 5 fee, rounded up)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: Array.from({ length: 7 }, () => ({ type: \"rune\" })) }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 198 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote premium 88 G for 2 runes + 1 moonstone (different types, no block)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"moonstone\" }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 88 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote premium 137 G for 3 runes + 3 moonstones (two separate blocks)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [\n        { type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" },\n        { type: \"moonstone\" }, { type: \"moonstone\" }, { type: \"moonstone\" },\n      ] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 137 }] });\n  });\n\n  // Item-specific modifiers\n  it(\"should quote premium 165 G for a cursed sword (base + 50% curse + first insurance + fee)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\", cursed: true }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 165 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote premium 145 G for a sword with enchantment 5 (base + 30% high enchant + first insurance + fee)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\", enchantment: 5 }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 145 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote premium 115 G for a sword with enchantment 4 (no high enchant)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\", enchantment: 4 }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 115 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote premium 195 G for a cursed, highly enchanted sword (both surcharges apply)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\", cursed: true, enchantment: 7 }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 195 }] });\n  });\n\n  // Policy-wide modifiers\n  it(\"should quote premium 95 G for a plain sword with a 2-year loyalty discount\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 2 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\" }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 95 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote premium 100 G for a plain sword on a follow-up contract\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [\n        { op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"amulet\" }] },\n        { op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\" }] },\n      ],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 71 }, { premium: 100 }] });\n  });\n\n  // Modifier scope and stacking\n  it(\"should apply cursed surcharge to the cursed item only and policy-wide modifiers to the policy base\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{\n        op: \"quote\",\n        items: [\n          { type: \"sword\", cursed: true },\n          { type: \"amulet\" },\n        ],\n      }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 231 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"should quote the newcomer-with-cursed-sword integration premium of 165 G\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\", cursed: true, material: \"steel\", enchantment: 3 }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 165 }] });\n  });\n  it(\